      "reason": "The pinned official Schedule plugin is otherwise mounted unchanged. Its exported TaskManagerPage opens manual creation entirely within component state and exposes no pre-create Host callback; an anonymous account cannot supply private workspace choices. A complete runtime fork adds only optional onBeforeCreate() to the injected Host contract and checks it before creating a local manual draft. The unchanged private registration omits the hook and preserves official behavior. The separate public-navigation plugin supplies the anonymous login gate, without label/DOM interception, fabricated catalog reads, or private RemoteAccess grants. Every copied source/resource is compared byte-for-byte with the pin after reversing these two declared additions.",
      "sourceReviewCommit": "9c2670d3bce5275e0d1610272958121af87787bb",
      "userApprovedDeviations": [
